# Alien Symbiosis: the discard is owed on every cast from the graveyard (CR 118.8, 601.2f), so with an empty hand
# the attempted cast is rolled back (CR 118.3, 733.1) when payment cannot be completed. Faithless Looting draws two
# Swamps and discards Alien Symbiosis and one Swamp; the other Swamp is played, leaving no card in hand. Mox Jet, Mox
# Pearl and the Swamp could pay {1}{B}, it is Bot1's main phase with the stack empty and Ornithopter is a creature to
# enchant, so only the discard keeps it from being cast.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Faithless Looting
Alien Symbiosis
Ornithopter
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

